 style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10pt\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼엑스포; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼엑스포; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼엑스포\">7. 심사방법 및 기준</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">가. 자격심사 </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">- 지</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">원서를 기준으로 자격요건 심사(석사학위 이상 소지자로 교육 또는 연구경력 1년 이상)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">나. 종합심사 </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">- 전</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">공적부, 경력, 강의계획서, 자기소개서 및 강의평가결과를 기준으로 교육</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">자 자질 및 사명감, 강의기법 등 평가 </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">다. 대상자 확정 </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">- 종</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">합심사 합격자를 대상으로(개별통보) 학별(과) 시간표에 따라 강의 가능한&nbsp;시간을 고려하여</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"> 순위 별로 위촉대상자 확정</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10pt\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼엑스포; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼엑스포; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼엑스포\">8. 기 타</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">가. 교</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">과목당 3과목까지 중복 지원 가능하며 담당시간은 최대 14시간을 초과할 수 없음</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">분반과 인원수는 변경될 수 있으며, 부득이한 사정으로 폐강되는 경우는 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">위촉하지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"> 않을 수도 있음 </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">다. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">전</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">업강사의 경우 시간당 70,000원, 비전업강사의 경우 시간당 30,000원의 강사료</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"> 지급</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">라. 지원서 입력 및 구비서류의 허위, 착오, 누락, 미비 등으로 인해 심사에 불이익이 발생할 경우에는 본인이 책임을 지며, 허위 사실로 확인될 경우 위촉을 취소할 수 있음</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"> </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">마. 금오공과대학교 시간강사 경력자의 경우 최근 2년간의 강의평가 결과 반영</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">바. 본 공고에 명시되지 않은 사항은 본교 인사관련 규정 및 인사관련 지침에 의함</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">사.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">기타 문의사항은 본교 교무처 교수지원팀으로 문의하시기 바랍니다.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"> </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">☞</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\"> 시간강사 공개채용 담당자 연락처</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;: 전화 (054)478-7025 / 팩스 (054)478-7034</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\"><font color=\"#0900ff\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"><font face=\"돋움\">☞</font></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\"> <a href=\"http://kumohweb.kumoh.ac.kr/mybsvr/tsp/w_tsp_login.html\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"#0900ff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">지원서 접수 바로가기(클릭)</span></font></a></span></font></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\">금오공과대학교총장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
